    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 11]\ntheorem erdos_489 : answer(sorry) ↔\n    ∀ (A : Set ℕ),\n      (fun x : ℕ => (((Finset.Icc 1 x).filter (· ∈ A)).card : ℝ)) =o[atTop]\n        (fun x : ℕ => (x : ℝ).sqrt) →\n      (sievedSet A).Infinite →\n      ∃ L : ℝ, Tendsto (fun x : ℕ => GapSumSq A x / (x : ℝ)) atTop (𝓝 L)",
